flowchart TD
    A[Story lands in PENDING_REVIEW] --> B[Reviewer opens queue]
    B --> C[Item renders with machine grade, category scores, matched terms]
    C --> D{Human decision}
    D -->|Approve| E[status → PUBLISHED + ReviewNote]
    D -->|Request revisions| F[status → REVISIONS_REQUESTED + ReviewNote mandatory]
    D -->|Defer| G[stays pending in queue]
    F --> H[Author sees note in My Stories]
    H --> I[Author edits draft, resubmits]
    I --> J[Machine rescan runs again]
    J --> B
    E --> K[Eligible for all readers' feeds]
